WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:12,020
you wake up

2
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:15,020
If you don't want your butt to get spanked, don't make a fuss.

3
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,020
let me sleep a little longer

4
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:20,710
How is your stay at home?

5
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:23,320
Haven't you been clamoring for your father?

6
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,320
Ah, Uncle Dashan

7
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,320
And the neighbor next door was very nice to Yuyu all night long.

8
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:30,340
And asked me to come back and supervise my mother

9
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:32,340
Did mom stay up late again last night?

10
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:34,340
Not good at all

11
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:35,340
The hair is not very old

12
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,340
I'm here

13
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:37,340
Which onion are you?

14
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,340
I'm not an onion

15
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:39,340
I am the fish king
